      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动在来到特雷森学园之前，\n是在儿童福利院度过的。据说这位老妇人，\n就是那里的园长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10f8d988700f23de73d39544b90e45cabec91362710843cb26627649687fdc5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
